(7485295, 1191325, 86447, '<td valign="top">Woah DANG!   This is creepy cool!   So... MUCH going on here.<br/> <br/>That eye and the body''s  (photographer''s) "eye"...   <br/> <br/> <br/>I''m just perusing.  I''ll be back to vote later.</td>', 'Woah DANG!   This is creepy cool!   So... MUCH going on here. That eye and the body''s  (photographer''s) "eye"...     I''m just perusing.  I''ll be back to vote later.', '2016-12-01 00:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485296, 1191165, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love that starburst!</td>', 'I love that starburst!', '2016-12-01 00:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485297, 1191460, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the scene.  Did you up the saturation?</td>', 'I love the scene.  Did you up the saturation?', '2016-12-01 00:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485298, 1191016, 86447, '<td valign="top">That HEART!!   I love it!</td>', 'That HEART!!   I love it!', '2016-12-01 00:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485299, 1191422, 86447, '<td valign="top">Whoa!   Fabulous in many ways!</td>', 'Whoa!   Fabulous in many ways!', '2016-12-01 00:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485300, 1191459, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the leading lines and their making us focus back on the shoppers.<br/> <br/>And... then... there''s that PUNCH of RED!</td>', 'I love the leading lines and their making us focus back on the shoppers. And... then... there''s that PUNCH of RED!', '2016-12-01 00:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485301, 1191392, 86447, '<td valign="top">Everything DPC... right here in one image.</td>', 'Everything DPC... right here in one image.', '2016-12-01 00:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485302, 1191232, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh.  I really don''t like these taillights photos.<br/> <br/>But... THERE!   You''ve given me ROAD in the middle of taillights blur!<br/> <br/>And then... you''ve given me more to follow after THAT!<br/> <br/> <br/>THIS is why I no longer enter Free Studies.<br/> <br/>Ha!<br/> <br/>You''ve done it.<br/> <br/>You''ve amazed me with a taillights image.<br/> <br/>I thought it could no longer be done.</td>', 'Oh.  I really don''t like these taillights photos. But... THERE!   You''ve given me ROAD in the middle of taillights blur! And then... you''ve given me more to follow after THAT!  THIS is why I no longer enter Free Studies. Ha! You''ve done it. You''ve amazed me with a taillights image. I thought it could no longer be done.', '2016-12-01 00:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485303, 1191425, 86447, '<td valign="top">I don''t like images like this.  I want images to be clear and well shot.<br/> <br/>I certainly don''t want the subject to be centered in an image that I don''t normally like.<br/> <br/>But... there''s something about her.<br/> <br/>You''ve captured her... being.<br/> <br/>And I am drawn in.  <br/> <br/>I love it.<br/> <br/>Do I want her to be more to the left or the right?<br/> <br/>With all of my being I want that.  <br/> <br/>:)<br/> <br/>But, I love her despite the composition.<br/> <br/>You''ve made me love her.</td>', 'I don''t like images like this.  I want images to be clear and well shot. I certainly don''t want the subject to be centered in an image that I don''t normally like. But... there''s something about her. You''ve captured her... being. And I am drawn in.   I love it. Do I want her to be more to the left or the right? With all of my being I want that.   :) But, I love her despite the composition. You''ve made me love her.', '2016-12-01 00:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485306, 1191357, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is when... what?<br/> <br/>I want to be drawn in... I want to feel the story in an image.<br/> <br/>I might be more drawn into the story if... the characters were more in focus.<br/> <br/>As it is here, I am focusing on the trees... since the "players" are so minimal in the image.<br/> <br/>I want... more.</td>', 'This is when... what? I want to be drawn in... I want to feel the story in an image. I might be more drawn into the story if... the characters were more in focus. As it is here, I am focusing on the trees... since the "players" are so minimal in the image. I want... more.', '2016-12-01 00:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485307, 1191118, 86447, '<td valign="top">Wow!  It looks like they''re 3D on my monitor.<br/> <br/>There''s not much detail in them... but they are IN MY FACE so really COOLly!</td>', 'Wow!  It looks like they''re 3D on my monitor. There''s not much detail in them... but they are IN MY FACE so really COOLly!', '2016-12-01 00:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485308, 1191443, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the laughter here!<br/> <br/> <br/>I wish Santa appeared to be enjoying the moment as much as the "kids" are, though.</td>', 'I love the laughter here!  I wish Santa appeared to be enjoying the moment as much as the "kids" are, though.', '2016-12-01 00:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485309, 1191441, 86447, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm... This is usually not anything that would appeal to me.<br/> <br/>But, you''ve done it.<br/> <br/>You''ve made me stop longer... look longer... and made me consider... more.<br/> <br/>I like this.<br/> <br/>Back to vote later.</td>', 'Hmmmm... This is usually not anything that would appeal to me. But, you''ve done it. You''ve made me stop longer... look longer... and made me consider... more. I like this. Back to vote later.', '2016-12-01 00:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485310, 1191446, 86447, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous differences!!</td>', 'Gorgeous differences!!', '2016-12-01 00:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485311, 1190503, 86447, '<td valign="top">Fabulous subject to impose your wonderful BW skills upon!</td>', 'Fabulous subject to impose your wonderful BW skills upon!', '2016-12-01 00:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485312, 1191473, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the composition. <br/> <br/>BUT... in my opinion, there needs to be something very sharply in focus in an image like this.<br/> <br/>That eye needs to COMMAND my attention... not get it when my eye finally gets there.<br/> <br/>But... that''s just an opinion.   All voters have an equal one.</td>', 'I love the composition.  BUT... in my opinion, there needs to be something very sharply in focus in an image like this. That eye needs to COMMAND my attention... not get it when my eye finally gets there. But... that''s just an opinion.   All voters have an equal one.', '2016-12-01 00:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485313, 1191339, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the composition... I love the BW...<br/> <br/>I love all of it except the fact that... when I finish exploring the image... I want her eyes to be open.<br/> <br/>I was disappointed when I got to her eyes.<br/> <br/>I know the sun was in them... but still... I wanted that BANG! at the end.</td>', 'I love the composition... I love the BW... I love all of it except the fact that... when I finish exploring the image... I want her eyes to be open. I was disappointed when I got to her eyes. I know the sun was in them... but still... I wanted that BANG! at the end.', '2016-12-01 00:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485314, 1190966, 86447, '<td valign="top">Great detail of a dead house fly... and it''s a wonderful place to practice macro studies... but... it''s so obviously dead that... I''d have waited to find a live one, after practicing on this one... and then I''d have entered that shot.<br/> <br/>Lovely colors...   And good focus.</td>', 'Great detail of a dead house fly... and it''s a wonderful place to practice macro studies... but... it''s so obviously dead that... I''d have waited to find a live one, after practicing on this one... and then I''d have entered that shot. Lovely colors...   And good focus.', '2016-12-01 00:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485315, 1191426, 30861, '<td valign="top">Whoa! This is simply stupendous. I''d love to have a 30x40 print of it :-) What the HECK is that platform halfway down the image and not far from the left edge? Feel free to PM me with info, you already have your 10 from me :-)</td>', 'Whoa! This is simply stupendous. I''d love to have a 30x40 print of it :-) What the HECK is that platform halfway down the image and not far from the left edge? Feel free to PM me with info, you already have your 10 from me :-)', '2016-12-01 00:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485316, 1191395, 30861, '<td valign="top">I hate that I can see the jesses on his ankle :-( Still, a striking shot.</td>', 'I hate that I can see the jesses on his ankle :-( Still, a striking shot.', '2016-12-01 00:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485317, 1191392, 30861, '<td valign="top">You guys having fun together? ;-)</td>', 'You guys having fun together? ;-)', '2016-12-01 00:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485320, 1191422, 30861, '<td valign="top">The title recalls to me this Frost poem:<br/> <br/>In winter in the woods alone<br/>Against the trees I go.<br/>I mark a maple for my own<br/>And lay the maple low.<br/> <br/>At four oclock I shoulder axe<br/>And in the afterglow<br/>I link a line of shadowy tracks<br/>Across the tinted snow.<br/> <br/>I see for Nature no defeat<br/>In one trees overthrow<br/>Or for myself in my retreat<br/>For yet another blow.</td>', 'The title recalls to me this Frost poem: In winter in the woods aloneAgainst the trees I go.I mark a maple for my ownAnd lay the maple low. At four oclock I shoulder axeAnd in the afterglowI link a line of shadowy tracksAcross the tinted snow. I see for Nature no defeatIn one trees overthrowOr for myself in my retreatFor yet another blow.', '2016-12-01 01:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485322, 1190503, 30861, '<td valign="top">Whoa, beautifully rendered! And it feels like a landscape I know well :-)</td>', 'Whoa, beautifully rendered! And it feels like a landscape I know well :-)', '2016-12-01 01:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
