(7485556, 1191325, 124815, '<td valign="top">Is this George  C. Scott or a look alike? Well done<br/>Oh no, i looked on a different monitor and it''s Johnny Cash - same fix, intense, penetrating gaze.  <br/>His gaze and the mundane background....I''ll bump th whole thing again</td>', 'Is this George  C. Scott or a look alike? Well doneOh no, i looked on a different monitor and it''s Johnny Cash - same fix, intense, penetrating gaze.  His gaze and the mundane background....I''ll bump th whole thing again', '2016-12-02 00:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485558, 1191332, 124815, '<td valign="top">I am in a dilemma - is this a prison or is it a church or a castle? The way you posted your camera makes this guessing game very interesting. The light does not help much clearing the mystery. There is a cooking fireplace...the plot thickens<br/>Bump</td>', 'I am in a dilemma - is this a prison or is it a church or a castle? The way you posted your camera makes this guessing game very interesting. The light does not help much clearing the mystery. There is a cooking fireplace...the plot thickensBump', '2016-12-02 00:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485559, 1191450, 124815, '<td valign="top">An endearing image without being sentimental; you just captured the impression of the street in front of you without paying attention to the unnecessary details<br/>And for this I raise the score</td>', 'An endearing image without being sentimental; you just captured the impression of the street in front of you without paying attention to the unnecessary detailsAnd for this I raise the score', '2016-12-02 00:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485561, 1190853, 124815, '<td valign="top">The city kid that I am looks at the expression of the wolf and imagines that a conversation coud sparkle anytime. No sense of fear here. This is as close to exchage glances with a winter hunter that I get and since the image is so calm and the few vegetations are nicely colored everything seems possible<br/>Bump</td>', 'The city kid that I am looks at the expression of the wolf and imagines that a conversation coud sparkle anytime. No sense of fear here. This is as close to exchage glances with a winter hunter that I get and since the image is so calm and the few vegetations are nicely colored everything seems possibleBump', '2016-12-02 00:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485562, 1191423, 124815, '<td valign="top">This coud be a lovely watercolor but it''s a very nice photo of the woods. You pushed gingerly the procesisng and even treated the edges to fot the watercolor technique. On a larger monitor it''s less inspiring so I take this moment and bump it</td>', 'This coud be a lovely watercolor but it''s a very nice photo of the woods. You pushed gingerly the procesisng and even treated the edges to fot the watercolor technique. On a larger monitor it''s less inspiring so I take this moment and bump it', '2016-12-02 00:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485563, 1191319, 124815, '<td valign="top">I turned this shot vertical on my ipad and lo and behold, it envelopped me in it and the stars started to give more light. <br/>Bump</td>', 'I turned this shot vertical on my ipad and lo and behold, it envelopped me in it and the stars started to give more light. Bump', '2016-12-02 00:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7485564, 1191232, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is the moment when the driver hopes that no deer or skonk will ever try to cross the road.<br/>It''a a little melody of the road that you captured here<br/>Bump</td>', 'This is the moment when the driver hopes that no deer or skonk will ever try to cross the road.It''a a little melody of the road that you captured hereBump', '2016-12-02 00:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
