(7486241, 1191422, 24744, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit of a dark halo around the moon which detracts from an otherwise strong image.</td>', 'There''s a bit of a dark halo around the moon which detracts from an otherwise strong image.', '2016-12-07 20:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486242, 1191067, 24744, '<td valign="top">When you were adding that tacky fake ripple effect to the water, you forgot to mask out a few of the rocks that ended up being ripply too.</td>', 'When you were adding that tacky fake ripple effect to the water, you forgot to mask out a few of the rocks that ended up being ripply too.', '2016-12-07 20:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486243, 1191319, 24744, '<td valign="top">I would have rotated this so the horizon is a little closer to level.</td>', 'I would have rotated this so the horizon is a little closer to level.', '2016-12-07 20:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486244, 1191476, 24744, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition and good balance of tones, one of my favourites in this contest.</td>', 'Very strong composition and good balance of tones, one of my favourites in this contest.', '2016-12-07 20:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486245, 1191435, 24744, '<td valign="top">You have what seems like a little bit of camera shake (or perhaps subject motion) in the entire image which loses you a bit of definition; there''s also some noticeable grain, but kudos for not trying to overcompensate with excessive sharpening.  I would perhaps have used a tighter crop to put the subject nearer one of the thirds.</td>', 'You have what seems like a little bit of camera shake (or perhaps subject motion) in the entire image which loses you a bit of definition; there''s also some noticeable grain, but kudos for not trying to overcompensate with excessive sharpening.  I would perhaps have used a tighter crop to put the subject nearer one of the thirds.', '2016-12-07 20:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486246, 1191441, 24744, '<td valign="top">Good colours and composition, I like this one.</td>', 'Good colours and composition, I like this one.', '2016-12-07 20:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486247, 1191199, 114285, '<td valign="top">So very lovely. But I would''ve probably cropped a third of the bottom off, the wirey bushes are not adding to the composition, in my humble opinion.</td>', 'So very lovely. But I would''ve probably cropped a third of the bottom off, the wirey bushes are not adding to the composition, in my humble opinion.', '2016-12-07 20:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486248, 1191430, 114285, '<td valign="top">Amazing piece of architecture. Can''t wait to see where this is. I probably would''ve darkened the highlights from the windows though.</td>', 'Amazing piece of architecture. Can''t wait to see where this is. I probably would''ve darkened the highlights from the windows though.', '2016-12-07 20:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486249, 1191382, 24744, '<td valign="top">Strong image, striking composition.  Unfortunately you have some very noticeable halos around the entire bird, especially some dark halos around the lower bright feathers on the nearer wing against the background, and a dark brown halo around its head - perhaps from manual burning of shadows taking too much of the midtones with it?  There are also some severe artefacts and grain around the short feathers of its flanks, again perhaps from excessive dodging and burning followed by aggressive sharpening.  On close inspection the boekh of the background is also full of stepped artefacts in places, especially near the middle of the frame.  Sharpening different parts of the image selectively to different extents might have helped to reduce that.</td>', 'Strong image, striking composition.  Unfortunately you have some very noticeable halos around the entire bird, especially some dark halos around the lower bright feathers on the nearer wing against the background, and a dark brown halo around its head - perhaps from manual burning of shadows taking too much of the midtones with it?  There are also some severe artefacts and grain around the short feathers of its flanks, again perhaps from excessive dodging and burning followed by aggressive sharpening.  On close inspection the boekh of the background is also full of stepped artefacts in places, especially near the middle of the frame.  Sharpening different parts of the image selectively to different extents might have helped to reduce that.', '2016-12-07 20:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486251, 1191388, 24744, '<td valign="top">Striking colours and composition, but I''m not a big fan of the overdone tonemap, especially where the tree branches in the top left begin to bleed dark halos into the surrounding sky.</td>', 'Striking colours and composition, but I''m not a big fan of the overdone tonemap, especially where the tree branches in the top left begin to bleed dark halos into the surrounding sky.', '2016-12-07 20:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486252, 1190853, 181814, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the composition is excellent as is your white balance and exposure.</td>', 'Very nice, the composition is excellent as is your white balance and exposure.', '2016-12-07 20:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486253, 1191430, 24744, '<td valign="top">Strong composition, and excellent work keeping a wide symmetrical composition so perfectly centered and balanced with no distractions.  One of my favourite shots in this contest.</td>', 'Strong composition, and excellent work keeping a wide symmetrical composition so perfectly centered and balanced with no distractions.  One of my favourite shots in this contest.', '2016-12-07 20:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486254, 1191379, 24744, '<td valign="top">Excellent colours.  Only minor complaint is that you seem to have a tiny bit of distortion bowing the horizon line down in the middle (or up at the sides, depending how you look at it) which you could correct in postprocessing.</td>', 'Excellent colours.  Only minor complaint is that you seem to have a tiny bit of distortion bowing the horizon line down in the middle (or up at the sides, depending how you look at it) which you could correct in postprocessing.', '2016-12-07 20:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486255, 1191425, 16148, '<td valign="top">Your subject centered on the tree works well.  Is this breaking a photography rule?  The repeating vertical lines of the forest is why it doesn''t detract and actually adds interest.  Beautiful photograph!</td>', 'Your subject centered on the tree works well.  Is this breaking a photography rule?  The repeating vertical lines of the forest is why it doesn''t detract and actually adds interest.  Beautiful photograph!', '2016-12-07 20:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486256, 1191437, 24744, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a candidate for gothsuptrees.net ;)  Good tones and startling sharpness.  If I were shooting, I would perhaps have opened the aperture a little more to sacrifice a little of that overall sharpness on their clothes in exchange for better bokeh in the background.  I would also have cropped it a little differently, as the central subject ends up a little uncomfortably juxtaposed with the negative space filling the right thirds and the tree filling the left thirds.</td>', 'Perhaps a candidate for gothsuptrees.net ;)  Good tones and startling sharpness.  If I were shooting, I would perhaps have opened the aperture a little more to sacrifice a little of that overall sharpness on their clothes in exchange for better bokeh in the background.  I would also have cropped it a little differently, as the central subject ends up a little uncomfortably juxtaposed with the negative space filling the right thirds and the tree filling the left thirds.', '2016-12-07 20:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486257, 1191071, 24744, '<td valign="top">Nice bold tones and composition for such a simple abstract.</td>', 'Nice bold tones and composition for such a simple abstract.', '2016-12-07 20:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486258, 1191332, 24744, '<td valign="top">Excellent tones and composition, and good use of sepia toning.</td>', 'Excellent tones and composition, and good use of sepia toning.', '2016-12-07 20:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486260, 1191426, 16148, '<td valign="top">Hong Kong?  The repeating window patterns along with subtle differences and details hold my attention.  Very enjoyable!</td>', 'Hong Kong?  The repeating window patterns along with subtle differences and details hold my attention.  Very enjoyable!', '2016-12-07 20:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486261, 1191360, 24744, '<td valign="top">Strong composition and concept - a really nice exploration of bokeh and lens distortion.  You have some patches of the background that show some noise uncharacteristic with the rest of the image, where it looks like you''ve either selectively sharpened parts of the drops near them and carelessly bled over into the background - or there were just some smudges on the glass pane you had the drops positioned on.  It''s visible especially around the drop on the lower left third, and the one near the middle on the bottom, which distract somewhat from the strength of the image - something that could be improved a lot just by cleaning that up in postprocessing.  Still, one of my favourites in this challenge.</td>', 'Strong composition and concept - a really nice exploration of bokeh and lens distortion.  You have some patches of the background that show some noise uncharacteristic with the rest of the image, where it looks like you''ve either selectively sharpened parts of the drops near them and carelessly bled over into the background - or there were just some smudges on the glass pane you had the drops positioned on.  It''s visible especially around the drop on the lower left third, and the one near the middle on the bottom, which distract somewhat from the strength of the image - something that could be improved a lot just by cleaning that up in postprocessing.  Still, one of my favourites in this challenge.', '2016-12-07 20:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486263, 1191181, 24744, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, and concept.  I would have perhaps cloned out the one bent fibre in the lower right third, as it catches the eye and takes attention away from the rest of the smoother lines in the image.</td>', 'Nice colours, and concept.  I would have perhaps cloned out the one bent fibre in the lower right third, as it catches the eye and takes attention away from the rest of the smoother lines in the image.', '2016-12-07 20:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486264, 1191261, 24744, '<td valign="top">The sharpening halos around the edges of the buildings, and the skyline sinking off the right edge of the frame asymmetrically to how it rises above the left, both mar an otherwise very strong composition.</td>', 'The sharpening halos around the edges of the buildings, and the skyline sinking off the right edge of the frame asymmetrically to how it rises above the left, both mar an otherwise very strong composition.', '2016-12-07 20:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486265, 1191460, 24744, '<td valign="top">Great colours and detail, not oversharpened, good image.</td>', 'Great colours and detail, not oversharpened, good image.', '2016-12-07 20:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486266, 1190842, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog take females to mall for cristmes shoping.</td>', 'Grog take females to mall for cristmes shoping.', '2016-12-07 20:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486267, 1191430, 56502, '<td valign="top">Amazing architecture, amazing shot!</td>', 'Amazing architecture, amazing shot!', '2016-12-07 20:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486269, 1191118, 24744, '<td valign="top">Nice concept; I find the background just a little more busy than ideal, but it''s overall a strong image.</td>', 'Nice concept; I find the background just a little more busy than ideal, but it''s overall a strong image.', '2016-12-07 20:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486270, 1190591, 24744, '<td valign="top">Excessive noise reduction / smoothing on the water and sky, and a few sharpening halos around the dark tree on the right.</td>', 'Excessive noise reduction / smoothing on the water and sky, and a few sharpening halos around the dark tree on the right.', '2016-12-07 20:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486271, 1191349, 56502, '<td valign="top">What a view, it comes across very well in your shot.</td>', 'What a view, it comes across very well in your shot.', '2016-12-07 20:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486272, 1191392, 24744, '<td valign="top">Just the same things to say about this as your other recent image of the same location - you have the same dark halos around the crags which really distract from an otherwise strong composition and good colours.  There''s also a smudge of contrast loss from where it looks like some flare has been cleaned up a bit on the left side, opposite the sun.<br/> <br/>I know you didn''t mark my last comment pointing out the same flaws in your other image as helpful, so I''m going to assume you''re not especially interested in improving your work - I''m simply leaving this comment for anyone who may come across this image later and wish to learn something from it.</td>', 'Just the same things to say about this as your other recent image of the same location - you have the same dark halos around the crags which really distract from an otherwise strong composition and good colours.  There''s also a smudge of contrast loss from where it looks like some flare has been cleaned up a bit on the left side, opposite the sun. I know you didn''t mark my last comment pointing out the same flaws in your other image as helpful, so I''m going to assume you''re not especially interested in improving your work - I''m simply leaving this comment for anyone who may come across this image later and wish to learn something from it.', '2016-12-07 20:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486273, 1190426, 24744, '<td valign="top">A little more sharpness on the rocks in the foreground would have improved this image; you also have a subtle red-blue halo on the cliff on the upper right, which looks like perhaps this is the result of an imperfectly aligned HDR stitch?  If not then it may be some sort of sharpening artefact from a tool I''m not familiar with.</td>', 'A little more sharpness on the rocks in the foreground would have improved this image; you also have a subtle red-blue halo on the cliff on the upper right, which looks like perhaps this is the result of an imperfectly aligned HDR stitch?  If not then it may be some sort of sharpening artefact from a tool I''m not familiar with.', '2016-12-07 20:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486274, 1191165, 24744, '<td valign="top">I''m not really a fan of seeing what''s basically the same image three times in different contests in the same week, but I can understand why you''d enter this in the free study alongside what I presume to be otto22''s shot.  You have some slight light sharpening halos around the crags, but you''ve managed to avoid his dark dodging and burning halos by going for a simpler edit.  The horizon is ever so slightly away from level, which could be fixed with a small rotation in postprocessing.</td>', 'I''m not really a fan of seeing what''s basically the same image three times in different contests in the same week, but I can understand why you''d enter this in the free study alongside what I presume to be otto22''s shot.  You have some slight light sharpening halos around the crags, but you''ve managed to avoid his dark dodging and burning halos by going for a simpler edit.  The horizon is ever so slightly away from level, which could be fixed with a small rotation in postprocessing.', '2016-12-07 20:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486275, 1190503, 24744, '<td valign="top">Good detail and sharpness throughout the frame, nice composition and good tones.  Almost Ansel-Adams-esque.  I think I know whose this might be.</td>', 'Good detail and sharpness throughout the frame, nice composition and good tones.  Almost Ansel-Adams-esque.  I think I know whose this might be.', '2016-12-07 20:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486276, 1191199, 24744, '<td valign="top">Good colours and composition, the flare has a pleasant vintage feel to it.  I would have cloned out the slightly incongruous power lines at the top right of the image.</td>', 'Good colours and composition, the flare has a pleasant vintage feel to it.  I would have cloned out the slightly incongruous power lines at the top right of the image.', '2016-12-07 20:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486278, 1190966, 24744, '<td valign="top">If you do need to stoop to a dead bug as your macro subject, it''s best to at least make some effort to make it look less dead.<br/> <br/>You also have a very clear line / squiggle / cutout shape especially visible in the upper right differentiating between the sharp and blurry portions of the image - a failed focus stacking effort perhaps?</td>', 'If you do need to stoop to a dead bug as your macro subject, it''s best to at least make some effort to make it look less dead. You also have a very clear line / squiggle / cutout shape especially visible in the upper right differentiating between the sharp and blurry portions of the image - a failed focus stacking effort perhaps?', '2016-12-07 20:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486279, 1191459, 24744, '<td valign="top">Quite Ray-Metzker-ish, good tone and composition.  Shame people don''t dress quite so well as in his photos anymore.</td>', 'Quite Ray-Metzker-ish, good tone and composition.  Shame people don''t dress quite so well as in his photos anymore.', '2016-12-07 20:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486280, 1191425, 24744, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the raise-the-shadows postprocessing here; done subtly it can make thigns look cinematic, but overdone clumsily it does the image no favours.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the raise-the-shadows postprocessing here; done subtly it can make thigns look cinematic, but overdone clumsily it does the image no favours.', '2016-12-07 20:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486281, 1191447, 24744, '<td valign="top">Good use of background texture, and strong composition and colours.  I find myself wishing the subject were a little sharper throughout, but still one of my favourite images in this free study.</td>', 'Good use of background texture, and strong composition and colours.  I find myself wishing the subject were a little sharper throughout, but still one of my favourite images in this free study.', '2016-12-07 20:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486282, 1191373, 24744, '<td valign="top">you have some odd lines running through the centre of the image there, where perhaps something has been cloned out carelessly?</td>', 'you have some odd lines running through the centre of the image there, where perhaps something has been cloned out carelessly?', '2016-12-07 20:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486283, 1191232, 24744, '<td valign="top">Good composition and concept.  The highlights on the road are just a bit blown out - a smaller aperture and consequently longer exposure might have helped that (but of course then you run the risk of ending up with star trails).</td>', 'Good composition and concept.  The highlights on the road are just a bit blown out - a smaller aperture and consequently longer exposure might have helped that (but of course then you run the risk of ending up with star trails).', '2016-12-07 21:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486284, 1191426, 24744, '<td valign="top">Nice follow-up, very Gursky-esque.  Excellent work keeping the verticals aligned so cleanly.  My only complaint is that the image overall could benefit from just a bit more critical sharpness - it''s hard to tell given the subject matter, but it may be that some fine detail in the windows was lost due to slightly over-sharpening.  One of my favourites in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice follow-up, very Gursky-esque.  Excellent work keeping the verticals aligned so cleanly.  My only complaint is that the image overall could benefit from just a bit more critical sharpness - it''s hard to tell given the subject matter, but it may be that some fine detail in the windows was lost due to slightly over-sharpening.  One of my favourites in this challenge.', '2016-12-07 21:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486285, 1191196, 24744, '<td valign="top">The centered subject leaves this composition feeling a little unbalanced, relative to the asymmetrical background.</td>', 'The centered subject leaves this composition feeling a little unbalanced, relative to the asymmetrical background.', '2016-12-07 21:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486297, 1191433, 112739, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.', '2016-12-07 21:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
