(7486419, 1190946, 112739, '<td valign="top">Nicely done Kees. I agree this should have placed higher. It looks like there are numerous possible compositions in this area. I also gave this an 8.</td>', 'Nicely done Kees. I agree this should have placed higher. It looks like there are numerous possible compositions in this area. I also gave this an 8.', '2016-12-08 13:04:49.000000', NULL, 0),
